  "title": {
    "zh": "DIY插珠帐篷夜光拼搭积木套装",
    "en": "DIY Glow Fort Building Block Set"
  },
  "summary": {
    "zh": "这是一款面向儿童创意拼搭场景的DIY插珠帐篷夜光套装，支持多功能拼接与自由搭建，适合家庭互动、课堂活动和主题布景使用。\n\n品牌为尧顺，产地东莞，支持DIY玩法与导购视频展示，包装规格清晰，便于渠道上架与采购。",
    "en": "This is a DIY glow fort set for children’s creative construction scenarios. It supports multi-functional assembly and free-form building, suitable for home interaction, classroom activities, and themed display setups.\n\nBrand: Yaoshun. Origin: Dongguan. DIY play and guide video support are available, and packaging dimensions are clearly defined for channel listing and procurement."
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": [
      "该款DIY插珠帐篷夜光拼搭积木套装采用杆件与连接球结构，可搭建帐篷、堡垒和主题空间，适合亲子互动和创意活动场景。",
      "产品支持多功能拼装与DIY重构，包含夜光玩法特性，便于在室内活动或展示场景中增强视觉表现。适合动手训练与空间认知类活动。",
      "商品采用彩盒包装，尺寸为43*26*11cm，杆子尺寸40cm，积木净重2.7KG。适用于零售、电商上架及批量采购。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "This DIY glow fort block set uses rods and connector balls to build tents, forts, and themed spaces, making it suitable for parent-child interaction and creative activity scenarios.",
      "It supports multi-functional assembly and DIY reconfiguration, with glow-play characteristics that improve visual presentation in indoor events and display setups. It is suitable for hands-on and spatial-learning activities.",
      "The product uses color-box packaging with a 43*26*11cm box size, 40cm rod size, and a 2.7kg net block weight, fitting retail, e-commerce listing, and bulk procurement needs."
    ]
  },
